{"unit_id":"FunnyDiodio__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"FunnyDiodio/dsh-session-delete","commit":"ccad78c9fe64769ba95b135d3fb5c34bf209973d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 是面向 DSH Web 界面的会话管理插件：它在侧边栏会话菜单中加入删除入口，并通过确认对话框让用户选择普通或强制删除。普通删除会检查会话是否仍在运行、存在未落盘内容或有后台活动；强制删除会尝试释放会话并停止后台工作。删除流程清理会话日志、投影缓存和注册表关联，并通知已连接界面移除会话行。适合需要清理旧会话记录的 DSH 用户；需要 DSH 及其 Web 界面，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:171-210","index.js:351-380","index.js:380-420"]}
{"unit_id":"FunnyDiodio__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"FunnyDiodio/dsh-session-delete","commit":"ccad78c9fe64769ba95b135d3fb5c34bf209973d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Adds a delete action and confirmation dialog to the DSH sidebar. Normal deletion checks for live sessions and activity; force deletion tries to release the session and stop its work. It removes logs, cache, and registry references, then updates connected clients. Requires the DSH web interface.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:171-210","index.js:351-380","index.js:380-420"]}
