{"unit_id":"FunnyDiodio__dsh-session-delete#feature-1","repo":"FunnyDiodio/dsh-session-delete","commit":"ccad78c9fe64769ba95b135d3fb5c34bf209973d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「侧栏删除入口」：在每个会话的更多菜单加入删除项。点击后打开确认对话框，用户可取消或提交删除请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:600-610","client.js:171-210"]}
