{"unit_id":"FunnyDiodio__dsh-session-delete#caveat-1","repo":"FunnyDiodio/dsh-session-delete","commit":"ccad78c9fe64769ba95b135d3fb5c34bf209973d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 使用前须知：删除会永久移除本机的会话日志与投影缓存，无法恢复；会话生成的工作区文件会保留，重要记录应先导出或另行保存。（见 client.js:182-210）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:182-210"]}
